      "writtenOn": "2018-12-20T14:37:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this potential cause an issue this access isn\u0027t guard by a memory barrier and could get re-ordered?\n\nThis optimization seems like it could cause subtle, non-atomic behavior, or am I missing something else?",
      "parentUuid": "b341df3e_66ad3b32",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 74,
        "startChar": 1,
